{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Immersive Clock 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的離線桌面時鐘兼專注計時器，內置 27 款風格各異的錶面，由極簡、翻頁到 Nixie、月相與世界時鐘，每一款均可即時預覽，適合長時間工作、溫習或喜歡整潔桌面擺設的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>豐富錶面與三段專注模式</h2>\n<p>專注模式分三段：一般模式可暫停與繼續，嚴格模式會記錄你離開 App 的時間，深度模式配合引導式取用減少打擾。Pomodoro 循環可自訂每輪專注、休息與階段提示，並調整目標、時長與音效。歷史只留在裝置，可查看七日圖表與連續達標次數。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-258-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-259-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-260-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-261-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-262-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-263-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Immersive Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T03:40:01.314272+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}